# PART 1 – STARTUP IDENTITY

## 1. Introduction

ZEVRO is an integrated digital marketplace that connects individuals and businesses with skilled, semi-skilled and general workers.

The platform brings together two major requirements:

1. Customers need reliable people to complete everyday services.
2. People need accessible opportunities to earn money through their skills and availability.

Businesses also require workers for temporary, part-time, daily, shift-based and contract-based requirements.

ZEVRO aims to connect all these groups through one digital platform.

It is designed around three main user groups:

- Customers who need services.
- Workers who want earning opportunities.
- Businesses that need workers.

### The central idea

Imagine three people:

**Person A:** Needs a mechanic because their vehicle has broken down.

**Person B:** Owns a warehouse and needs 30 packaging workers.

**Person C:** Has skills but is struggling to find work.

ZEVRO connects all three.

Person A books a mechanic.

Person B posts a workforce requirement.

Person C registers and finds suitable work.

This is the fundamental purpose of ZEVRO.

